>02</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>兴趣与志向</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>对茶学研究有浓厚兴趣，有志于从事园艺茶学方向研究，具备一定试验技能。能取得所在学校研究生推荐免试资格者优先</span></span><span>！</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>学业表现</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>双一流院校学生：综合成绩排名年级前40%。</span></span></p><p><span><span>普通院校学生：综合成绩排名年级前30%。</span></span></p><p><span><span>无补考记录，无违纪处分，确保能正常获得本科毕业证和学位证。</span></span></p><p><span><span>英语能力：通过大学英语四级考试</span></span><span>。</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请必备材料</span></strong></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>请提前准备好以下材料的电子版（用于邮件提交）和纸质版（用于报到时提交）：</span></p><p><strong><span>《茶叶研究所2025年暑期夏令营报名表》</span></strong><span> (务必下载附件填写完整)</span></p><p><strong><span>外语水平证明复印件</span></strong><span> (如CET-4/6级成绩单)</span></p><p><strong><span>本科阶段成绩单</span></strong><span> &amp; </span><strong><span>专业排名证明原件</span></strong><span> (需加盖学校成绩管理专用公章)</span></p><p><strong><span>其他证明材料复印件</span></strong><span> (如已发表论文、获奖证书等，可选择性提供)</span></p><p><strong><span>学生证复印件</span></strong><span> (注册信息齐全) 或 在校证明复印件</span></p><p><strong><span>身份证复印件</span></strong><span> (正反面复印在同一页)</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/vcEWusPZ4YScLDXu9sVbbSFnscjV9ENQWujjIqicBiajYFQzsc4mpvSiclLQxGdLib6vmIXczAkOv8wo3EsugXm5Cg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><strong><span>在线报名：</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>截止时间：2025年7月10日 下午4点前</span></span></p><p><span><span>报名链接：https://www.wjx.cn/vm/wToPDJt.aspx# (请复制到浏览器打开或直接点击)</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>材料提交：</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>截止时间：2025年7月10日前</span></span></p><p><span><span>提交方式：将所有申请材料电子版压缩打包发送至邮箱：sunyizhao@caas.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮件标题格式：姓名+本科院校+2025年夏令营 (例如：张三+XX大学+2025年夏令营)</span></span></p><p><span><span>资格审核：我们将严格审核材料，确保真实有效。弄虚作假者将立即取消资格。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>名单公布：</span></span></strong><span><span> </span></span></span></p><p><span><span>审核通过者名单将在茶叶研究所官网 (http://www.tricaas.com) 公布，并通过邮件或电话通知本人。未通过者不再另行通知，敬请谅解。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>暖心福利，无忧参营！</span></strong></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><strong><span>重要须知 </span></strong></p><p><span>学员需全程参与夏令营各项活动。</span></p><p><span>入所后需遵守研究所及实验室规章制度，并签订科研实践活动安全协议。</span></p><p><span>请自行预定往返车票，研究所不提供订票服务。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/vcEWusPZ4YScLDXu9sVbbSFnscjV9ENQj0Y2T0t3Jt2rc7MWLdKukUYeh5LgfgIOjMMzXNrZ3syveRHviaBxgbg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><strong><span>想了解更多招生信息及导师风采？</span></strong></p></section><section><p><span><span>茶叶研究所官网： http://www.tricaas.com</span></span></p><p><span><span>茶叶所导师介绍：http://caas.teacher.360eol.com/teacher/teacherIndexList?collegeId=13005 (复制链接到浏览器查看)</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span>联系我们 (📞)</span></span></strong><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>如有疑问，欢迎咨询：</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系人：孙老师 (或根据实际情况调整)</span></span></p><p><span><span>电话：0571-86652960</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮箱：sunyizhao@caas.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span>地址：浙江省杭州市西湖区梅灵南路9号 (邮编：310008)</span></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><span>行动起来，莫失良机！</span><span><br/></span><span>点击报名链接，提交申请材料，</span><span><br/></span><span>这个夏天，让我们相约西子湖畔，</span><span><br/></span><span>在中国农业科学院茶叶研究所，</span><span><br/></span><span>共品茶香，共话科研，共筑未来！</span></span></p><p><span><span>【温馨提示】 请务必关注 茶叶研究所官网 (http://www.tricaas.com) 获取最新通知及参营名单！</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/vcEWusPZ4YScLDXu9sVbbSFnscjV9ENQe6wDWGZNtQ5mxDPwJwIW3NktqIOLeVCoEUz6SAS5XiaPRbX87R9Ae8w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>文字：韩鑫瑶</span></p><p><span>图片来源于官网</span></p><p><span>审核：姜慧敏</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"9ea72d38c1c9fa133addd27f417576e200d4f664ba4718811e0dddb7a1cfd34b","textLength":1425,"sourceSha256":"0006e0a469e423f074d84a020e538a4aa49640c65aac8a812c8d9446a24a84f1","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-f5459e4caefc60cd444b","title":"2025年中国农业科学院茶叶研究所2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:21.456391+00:00"}
